{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"],"anchor":"The-content-bundle","title":"The content bundle","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DangerousDark","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let dark = DangerousDark()          \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace","","var content: GameContents {","    dark","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"ending","type":"text"}]},{"text":" in darkness, wherever","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they’re spent — lingering is lethal, movement is not — so the warning","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn is a guarantee (the classic fairness contract) and a lightless dash","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"toward daylight can still succeed. Any reachable light resets the count.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Death is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dice roll","type":"text"}]},{"text":" once the grace runs out, the original’s grue:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the first dark turn only warns, a configurable grace of guaranteed-safe","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turns follows, and then every further dark turn rolls ","type":"text"},{"code":"chance(lethality)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be eaten. The warning is always safe, so a revived player (UNDO) still","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"gets the warning beat before the dice can turn on them again.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To make the dark harmless for a stretch — a room whose solution is to stand","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in it on purpose, a scene that should not be interrupted — set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not stop the daemon by name.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming can land the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player straight on a dice turn and cost them the warning; suspending resets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the count for exactly that reason.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon is named ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"grue\""},{"text":". Timer names are global, but two instances","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DangerousDark"},{"text":" in one game already collide on their shared ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"namespace before the timer name matters — one lethal dark per game.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning on the first consecutive turn the player"},{"type":"text","text"